&lt;h2 id="general-installation-instructions">General installation instructions&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Thingsee POWERCOVER is installed to the desired place with a double sided tape. The installation placement depends on the sensor that is used with the Thingsee POWERCOVER.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Thingsee POWERCOVER can be delivered either with the sensor device already installed to the Thingsee POWERCOVER or without it.&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>